	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(100.0, 330.0, 380.0, 130.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 15. In Corpus, make sure only `Text` is the text feature. The Reference Library has its own query box and the Ollama RAG has its own prompt: keep them about the same question. The same SBERT Embedder must feed both Text Embedder and Reference Library.*</text>
	</annotations>
